ction&quot;&gt;manifest.json&lt;/span&gt;&#xa;          &lt;span style=&quot;background-color:#fff2cc;&quot; title=&quot;Planned stage: providercollection&quot;&gt;index.json&lt;/span&gt;&#xa;          &lt;span style=&quot;background-color:#fff2cc;&quot; title=&quot;Planned stage: providercollection&quot;&gt;provider.json&lt;/span&gt;&#xa;  &lt;span style=&quot;background-color:#fff2cc;&quot; title=&quot;Planned stage: selectionexport&quot;&gt;selections/&lt;/span&gt;&#xa;    &lt;span style=&quot;background-color:#fff2cc;&quot; title=&quot;Planned stage: selectionexport&quot;&gt;{module-id}/&lt;/span&gt;&#xa;      &lt;span style=&quot;background-color:#fff2cc;&quot; title=&quot;Planned stage: selectionexport&quot;&gt;{context}/&lt;/span&gt;&#xa;        &lt;span style=&quot;background-color:#fff2cc;&quot; title=&quot;Planned stage: selectionexport&quot;&gt;{selection-id}.json&lt;/span&gt;&#xa;  &lt;span style=&quot;background-color:#fff2cc;&quot; title=&quot;Planned stage: corecollection&quot;&gt;terraform/&lt;/span&gt;&#xa;    &lt;span style=&quot;background-color:#fff2cc;&quot; title=&quot;Planned stage: corecollection&quot;&gt;core/&lt;/span&gt;&#xa;  &lt;span style=&quot;background-color:#fff2cc;&quot; title=&quot;Planned stage: selectionexport&quot;&gt;tracks/&lt;/span&gt;&#xa;    &lt;span style=&quot;background-color:#fff2cc;&quot; title=&quot;Planned stage: selectionexport&quot;&gt;{context}/&lt;/span&gt;&#xa;      &lt;span style=&quot;background-color:#fff2cc;&quot; title=&quot;Planned stage: selectionexport&quot;&gt;index.json&lt;/span&gt;&#xa;  &lt;span style=&quot;background-color:#dae8fc;&quot; title=&quot;factory-discovery&quot;&gt;catalog.json&lt;/span&gt;&#xa;  dataset.json&#xa;  schema.json&lt;/pre&gt;Shared category/module identity; accepted evidence differs from operational state. Provider type-first paths are proposed, not implemented. Direct source folders retain independent immutable evidence; curation is reviewed manual input. Version manifests 